<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">Ruth</book>
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaihawmmite’n vai a hawmlai un hichi ahi. Huai gam ah kial a kia hi. Judah gam a Bethlehem mi khat Moab gam a teng tadih din amah leh a zi leh a tapate nih toh a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai mi min Elimelek ahi, a zi min Naomi ahi, a tapate nih min Malon leh Kilon ahi. Amau Judah gam a Bethlehem, Ephrath mi ahi uh. Moab gam ah a hoh ua, huai ah a om nilouh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elimelek, Naomi pasal a si a, amah leh a tapate nih kia ahita uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau Moab gam numei zi in a nei ua, a khat pen min Orpah ahi a, a khat pen min Ruth ahi. Huai ah kum sawm a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahlon leh Kilon a si tuaktuak ua; huchi in huai numei a tate nih leh a pasal in a sihsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in a moute toh Moab gam apan kiknawn din a kisa uh. Toupa’n nekding pia a mite a vehdan Moab gam apan a na zak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in a omna apan a moute nih toh a pawt ua; Judah gam a kiknawn din a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Naomi in a mou nihte kiang ah,“Na nute uh inn tuak ah pai nawnta un. Misi tung leh ka tung a siamtak a na hih bang un Toupa’n na tung uah hih hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n na nih un na pasalte uh inn a khawlna na muh theihna ding un hon hehpih hen” a chi hi. Huchi in a tawp a, aw suah hial in a kapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau a kiang ah, “Pai kei nung, na chite kiang a na paina ah ka tel sam ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naomi in, “Ka tanute aw, pai nawn zaw un. Bangziak a ka kiang a hongpai sam mahmah ding na hi ua? Na pasal ding uh tapate ka pai thei nawn dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tanute aw, Kisa unla, pai un. Pasal nei din lah ka upa lawta ngal a. Lametna ka nei chimah leng, tuzan mahmah in leng pasal nei in tapate leng neimah leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a pichin tan ua om ding na hi ding uam? Pasal lou in na om nilouh ding ua hia? Hi tellou e, ka tanute aw; nou ziak in ka lungkhamna a uang semsem hi. Toupa khut ka tung a tu eita ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A aw uh suah in a kapnawn leuleu uh. Huchi in Orpah in a pi a tawp a; Ruth in bel a len chinten hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman, “Ngai in, na moupihnu a chite kiang leh a pathian kiang ah a pai kiknawnta. Nang leng na moupihnu delh inla, pai nawnta in aw” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ruth in, “Nang khen ding leh nang zuilou a kiknawn ding in hon kun ken. Na paina peuh ah ka pai dia; na giahna peuh ah ka giak dia; na chite ka chite ahi ding ua, na Pathian ka Pathian ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na sihna peuh ah ka si dia, huai ah n’on vuisam ding ahi. Nang leh kei sihna loungal thil dang in a honkhen leh Toupa’n a hihhih in honhih henla, hiai sang a thupizaw in leng” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in a kiang a pai a tum chiltel chih a theih in a daihsanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Bethlehem tan a paikhawmta uh. Hichi ahi a, Bethlehem a tun un, a khozang un a ling ua, numeite’n, “Hiai Naomi ahi maw?” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman a kiang uah, “Naomi honchi kei un. Marah honchi zaw un.” Bangkim hihtheipa’n lah khatak in a hon hihta ngal a, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Buchingtak in ka pawt a, Toupa’n a vuak in a honpi nawn hi. Toupa’n ka tung ah a lungkim louhna a hihlang a, Bangkim hihtheipa’n a honhih gentheih dan theigige napi a bangdia Naomi honchi lailai na hi ua?“ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Naomi a hongkik a, a mounu Moab mi Ruth toh Moab gam apan a hongkik uhi. Barli buh lak pattung lai in Bethlehem a hongtung uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Naomi in a pasal tanau, Elimelek suan, mi neizoutak tanau a nei a; a min Boaz ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab mi Ruth in Naomi kiang ah, “Lou ah hon hohsak in. Mi lou ah hon hehpihmi buhsang ka va zong ding aw,” a chi hi. Aman a kiang ah, “Hoh ve, ka tanu” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in a hohta a, buhlamite lakmaih a vazong a; huchi in Elimelek suan Boaz lou ah a va hoh kha geih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in, ngai in, Bethlehem apan Boaz a vahoh a, buhlamite kiang ah, “Na kiang uah Toupa om hen, a chi hi. Amau Toupa’n nang hon vualzawl hen” chi in a dawng uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Boaz in a sikha, buhlamite tung a heutu kiang ah; “Hiai kua nungaknou ahia oi?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A buhlamite tung a heutu a sikha in, “Moab nungaknou, Moab gam apan Naomi toh hongpai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman, ‘hon hehpih inla, na buhsang ka zong dia, buhlamite’n a buhphal uh a lakkhawm khit chiang un ka zong zel ding aw’ a chi hi. Huchi in a hongpai a, in a tomchik a om chihlouh zingsang apan a om nilouh hi,” chi in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Boaz in Ruth kiang ah, “Ka tanu, ngai dih. Buhsang zong in lou dang ah hoh kenla, hiai apan pai ken. Ka sikha nungakte kiang ah om gige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A buhlak uh en gige inla, a nung uh suizel in. Tangvalte nang bangmah hon chihlou din thu ka pevekta hi. Na dangtak peuh chiang in tuibel a tangvalte tui tawisa dawnzel in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in a kun a, leisi in a khupboh a, a kiang ah, “Namdang hinapi ing a, nang hichibang a n’on theihnopa n’on na hehpih bangchidan ahia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Boaz in a dawng a, a kiang ah, “Na pasal sih nungsiah na pi tung a na thilhih dan tengteng min a honhilh vek uh. Na nu leh na pa leh na pianna gam paisan a tuma lam in a na mi theih ngeilouhte kiang a na hongpai dante leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n na thilhih hondin henla, Toupa , Israelte Pathian, ki humbitna dia a kha nuai na muan in kipahman tampi honpia hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman, “Ka toupa, hon hehpih in. Nang n’on lungmuan a, na sikha nungakte lak a mi hi kei mah leng, na sikhanu hoihtak in n’on houpihta ngal a” a chi hi. copy
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Annek hun in Boaz in a kiang ah, “Hongpai inla, Tanghoute hong ne sam inla, tanghou themte uain thuk ah hong diah sam in” a chi hi. Huchi in buhlamite kiang ah a tu a; buhkan a pia a; a ne a, a nek nung in leng a khamval lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Buhsang zong dia a dinnawn in, Boaz in a tangvalte kiang ah, “Buhphalte lak ah leng tawmsak zel unla, tai kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A lomte leng dohkhiak sak unla, nutsiat zel unla, tom henla, tai kei un” chi’n thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in lou a buhsang nitaklam tan in a zong hi. A zonsa a khen a, barli buh ephah khat hiam tak a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A van kisuan in khopi ah a paita hi. A pi in a buhsang zon a na mu a; aman a nek khamval a sitte a suahkhia a, a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pi in a kiang ah, “Tuni a koilam a buhsang zong na hia? Koi ah ahia na va sep? A hon na thei nuampa vualzawl in om hen” a chi hi. Aman kua kiang ah ahia a vasep chih a pi a hilh hi. “Tuni a ka va nasepna min Boaz ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naomi in a mounu kiang ah, “ Toupa , mihing leh misi tung a a hehpihna tawp tuan ngeilou in amah vualzawl hen” a chi hi. Naomi in a kiang ah, “Huai mi, i kinaihpih, i tanau bul eive” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moab mi Ruth in, “Kei kiang ah leng honchi eive” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Naomi in a mounu Ruth kiang ah, “Ka tanu, lou dang a a honmuh hetlouhna din a sikha nungakte lak ngen ah pai lechin a hoih ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in, barli buh leh buhpi lakkhit mateng Boaz sikha nungakte lak kia ah buhsang zong in a hoh a, a pi kiang ah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, a pi Naomi, a pasal nu’n a kiang ah, “Ka tanu, nang adin khawlna k’on zonsak kei dia hia, huchi in nang adin a hoih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I tanaupa Boaz, a sikha nungakte toh nna nasepnapa om hilou hia? Ngai in, tuzan in phual ah barli buh a zapsiang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in, kisil inla, thau kinilh inla, na kizepna puansilh inla, phual ah va hohsuk in. Himahleh an ne a, a dawn khit masiah a kiang ah kitheisak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, a lup chiang in a lupna chiamteh inla, lut inla, a khe lem inla, va lum in. Aman na hih ding a honhilh ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Na gen teng ka hih ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in phual ah a hohsuk a, a pi hilh bang in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Boaz in an a ne a, a dawn khit in a lungtang a kipak a, buhvum bul a lum din a paita hi. Amah awlawl in a hongpai a, a khe a lem a, a lumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, zan lai in huai mipa a lauta a, a langkhat a nga a; ngai in, a khe kiang ah numei khat a na lumta mai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman, “Kua na hia?” a chi hi. Aman, “Na sikhanu Ruth ka hi. Huchi in na sikhanu na puan honzawn in, ka tanau bul lah na hi ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman, “Ka tanu, Toupa’n nang hon vualzawl hen. Tangval genthei hiam, hausa hiam na zuihlouh in a tunglai sang in a nunglam ah hoihna na hihlang zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in ka tanu, lau ken aw. Na gen bang in na tung ah ka hih ding. I khua a mi tengteng in numei kizentak na hi chih a thei vek ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kitanau nai i hi ngut hi. Himahleh kei sang a naizaw a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuzan zaw om peuhmah inla, zing chiang zingsang in na tung a aman a tanau hih ding a hihnop leh a hoih hi. Himahleh tanau hih ding na tung a a hihnop kei leh, tanau hih ding pen Toupa a hin bang in ken ka hih ding. Zingsang tan lum nilouh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in zingsang tan in a khebul ah a lum hi. Kuamah a kimuh chian theihma in a thoukhia hi. Aman, “Phual ah numei a hong chih himhim kuamah in theikei hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kiang ah, “Na puansilh la inla, doh in” a chi hi. Huchi in a doh a, barli buh tehna guk a teh a, a suan a; huchi in khua ah a paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pi kiang a tun in, “Ka tanu, bang n’ong chi a?” a na chi hi. Aman, huai mipa in a tung a thil a na hih tengteng a hilhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hiai barli buh tehna guk a honpia a, ‘na pi kiang ah a vuak in pai ken,’ ” a honchi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman, “Ka tanu, bangchibang in ahia thil a hongom ding na theih ma in tu maimai in. Tuni a hiai thil a hih khit mateng huai mipa dai mailou ding ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Boaz kulh kongpi ah a hohtou a, huai ah a tu hi. Ngai in, a tanau bul uh a tungtang thu Boaz in a gen a hongpai hi. Huai mi kiang ah, “E! nang na hi maw! hongpai inla, tu dihve” a chi hi. Amah hongpai in a tuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai khua a upate lak a mi sawm a pi a, a kiang uah, “Hiai ah tu dih ua” a chi a, huchi in amau a tuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tanau bul uh kiang ah, “Moab gam apan hongkik Naomi in i unaupa Elimelek gam a zuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in khomite mitmuh leh ka mite upate mitmuh in lei in. Na tat nop leh tan in. Himahleh na tatnop kei leh ka theih theihna din honhilh in. Nang lou lah kuamah a tan dia kilawm a om ngalkei uh. Nang zom in kei ka hi chih nang hon theihsak kiphamawh in ka thei” a chi hi. Aman, “Ka tan ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Boaz in, “Naomi khut apan huai gam na lei nin, misi zi, Moab numei Ruth apan misi min beilou a, a gouluah ding mi a om zel theihna din na lei tel ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tanau bulpa in, “Kei adin zaw ka tan theikei. Huchilou in zaw keimah gouluah ka mansuah kha ding. Ka tat theihna nang tangmai in. Ken zaw tan theilou ka himai hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nidanglai a Israelte lak a thil bangkim a hihkipna ding ua a kitat dan uleh a kikhen dan uh hichi ahi. Khedap a phel ua, a vengte uh a pia ua, huai Israelte lak a a hihdan uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in a tanau bulpa un Boaz kiang ah, “Nang adin lei zaw in” a chi hi. Huchi in a khedap a phelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Boaz in upate leh mipi tengteng kiang ah, “Tuni in noute Elimelek thilneih tengteng leh Kilon leh Mahlon thilneih tengteng Naomi khut apan ka lei chih theihpihtute na hi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai kia hilou in misi min a manlouhna din Moab numei Ruth, Mahlon zi ka zi din ka lei a, huai, tuni in noute a theihpihtute na hi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kulh kongpi a mipi tengteng leh upate’n, “Theihpihtute ka hi uh. Na in a numei honglut Rakil leh Leah, Israel inkuan dingsak nihte bang in Toupa’n bawl hen. Nang Ephrathah ah suanhuaitakin hongom inla, Bethlehem ah minthangtakin hongom in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n hiai nungaknou apan suan a hon bawlsak ding ziak in na inkuan uh Tamar in Judah a suansak Perez inkuan bang honghi hen” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Boaz in Ruth a pi a, a zi a hong hita hi. Huchi in a luppih a, Toupa’n nau a paisak a, tapa a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Numeite’n Naomi kiang ah, “Tuni mahmah a tanau nai bei a hon omsak lou, Toupa phat in om hen. Israelte lak ah a min hongthang hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah na hinna tungdingpa leh na teklam a hon vakpa a honghi dia; na mounu nang hon it nu, tapa sagihte sang a nang adia hoih in amah lah a suangta ngal a” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naomi in nau a la a, a pom a, a donta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A inveng numeite’n a min a phuak ua, “Naomi adin tapa a hong piangta” chi’n a min Obed a sa uhi. Amah, David pa Jesse pa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiaite Perez suante ahi uh. Perez in Hezron a suang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hezron in Ram a suang a; Ram in Aminadab a suang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aminadab in Nashon a suang a, Nashon in Salmon a suang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Salmon in Boaz a suang a, Boaz in Obed a suang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Obed in Jesse a suang a, Jesse in David a suang hi.
  </para>
</usx>
